{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "c0af0b4f007f251a223e4ce6ebf93d0184670c8d3e885e5e183c19065f88d022", "ja": "私たちの星座", "zh": "我们的星座", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e4874297c2734c5a357245acd9a429ffef296fa3de03db0a5e4f1ec04cf4eb98", "ja": "天体公演シリーズが定期化する事となった。\nメンバーに選ばれた恵美、瑞希、歩は舞台で\nそれぞれの持ち味を発揮して欲しいと告げら\nれ、互いに自分が持っているものを再確認。\nユニット名も決まりレッスンを開始する。", "zh": "一系列的天体公演即将定期举办。\n制作人挑选惠美、瑞希、步作为公演成员，\n并希望她们能发挥出各自的特色，\n于是她们再次确认了自己的长处。\n而三人的团体名称也敲定，准备开始练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0713d962c0f570a41f6d85da5407b9b335dc4530f5debaf4f20841b3057fc52b", "ja": "（今日は次の天体公演の初打ち合わせだ。\nさあ、もうみんな揃ってるかな？）", "zh": "（今天是下一场天体公演的首次会议。\n好，大家都到齐了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "6b482c5458d95b5cb70ccff51951958ef8c8fe4123429d822b301a7ecd4715c7", "ja": "でね～、瑞希はカチッとしたジャケット\nスタイルとか、クールで似合うと思うんだよね～！", "zh": "然后啊～我觉得瑞希可以穿上俐落的西装外套，\n帅气的风格一定很适合你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "e59a9362a121c4f377d26a9ce3ba8fe0d3bf98c77bac63bae110fe16507ad918", "ja": "なるほど。ジャケット。\nたしかに、実は好きかも……キリッ。", "zh": "原来如此。西装外套。\n我也许还挺喜欢的……（正色）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "869bf5061017342c563118074c1682802fca030237688195b559fbe3d10dc406", "ja": "やっぱそうでしょ～！　でね、歩はストリート\n系も似合うけど、案外ロマンチック系とかさ……♪", "zh": "我就说吧～！至于步呢，你很适合街头风格，\n不过走浪漫路线或许也不错哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a9a6eadd240c28d095afe31e5c786f445afb01ae3a05624a0d6e0e5161090e06", "ja": "マジ！？　ちょっと照れるよ、それ！\nアタシそんなの着てもいいのかなー？", "zh": "真的吗！？可是我会有点难为情耶！\n我真的适合穿那种衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "7a80bd5ebf18614f87e189af20fbb839d839913e471b1c692ebc31b05856a532", "ja": "舞浜さんは髪を下ろすと、そういうのにハマる\nかもしれませんね。……キューティ・アユム。", "zh": "舞滨姊把头发放下来的话，也许会很适合那样的服饰。\n……可爱小步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4aa1c26f1599a4d58ea4c88e852ca83b4ae4773e4f84334af2fb4a5f9ab1fdbc", "ja": "へへっ、そうかなっ！？　じゃ、じゃあ今度\nちょっとだけ……。いやあ、やっぱハズいって！", "zh": "嘿嘿！是吗！？那、那我下次就试穿一下……\n不行啦，我还是觉得很害羞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3de76323d2eadb13be841c05807a79eb46bf8b159a8608128a34e087d95d9d34", "ja": "（ガールズトークに花が咲いてるらしい。\nうん、いい感じにリラックスしてるみたいだな）", "zh": "（她们三个女孩似乎聊得很开心。\n嗯，看来有了适度的放松。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a6cfc054cbf1ef7561ee4804d3a8ed2949e123bf195ca6fabec3fcca1bd2107", "ja": "みんな、おはよう！　ファッションの話か？", "zh": "大家早！你们在聊穿搭的话题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "24c9d538b6a350dc30807105ae0a5fa8928e347885c807068015211cfe6d5ede", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、おっはよ！\n今ね、今度みんなで買い物に行こうって話してて。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，早啊！\n我们正讲到下次要一起去逛街买东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9e7ee31d920de5e35507a7fadffea9bb3cefe6776fd1b5757a3805a4151c6e90", "ja": "それで恵美が色々とアドバイスしてたんだな。\nショッピング、楽しんで来るといい。ところで……。", "zh": "所以惠美你才会提出各种建议吗？\n你们就好好逛个街吧，而我今天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "26948b7d698d949f255edab483a874236168701a9a3bd452ede63c895fc9aebe", "ja": "こうして私たちが、何人かピックアップして\n呼ばれた、ということは……さては、アレですね。", "zh": "制作人挑选出我们几个人找来这里，\n这也就是说……应该是那件事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "863f95ba0f4bb41ee8ed8b4555c0557032dd35e9557156ca6a92a1fac8be9270", "ja": "アレ？　ってなに、{$P$}？", "zh": "那件事？什么事啊，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "14134593ab468870b5241ba730c66f57034d0e6a18d2ad84394fccdecac8d862", "ja": "たぶん、瑞希の想像通りかな。今度の公演では、\nこの3人で歌ってもらおうと考えてるんだ。", "zh": "瑞希她应该猜中了。\n我希望你们三位在这次的公演上演唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "55086c0f196e4caa867bebe11dbdd80c27716bf3af2dd72d221be0d1d37c8b55", "ja": "おー！　やったやった！\nなに？　今度はどんな公演？", "zh": "喔──！太棒啦！\n所以呢？这次是怎样的公演？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "28c5de4dbcdef61a7e275f23e2659c366608abf0fa82f98ec55d5a6489c7216f", "ja": "前に天体をテーマにした公演をやっただろ？\nあれを定期化して、またやろうと思ってる！", "zh": "之前大家不是举办过以天体为主题的公演吗？\n我想要继续举办，变成定期公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "23eddd60c551b29a4615760fec11817f7a824d79ca9fedf91dafdfe7706ddced", "ja": "いいじゃんいいじゃん♪　アタシも前から\nあれ、よかったな～って思ってたの！　なんか嬉しい♪", "zh": "好耶好耶♪我从之前就一直觉得\n那种公演很棒了！好开心喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8abbb02eff88f2ce964a814057f25be910ecfbed5ab54d4db392f65e95733925", "ja": "喜んでもらえて、俺も嬉しいよ。\nで、3人に歌ってもらう曲だけど……", "zh": "看到你们这么喜欢，我也很开心。\n然后，关于要请你们三位唱的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cea088e6a6881b120e7ca9251a28c02dbaf9428576daa1e6353bd5a686fd87bc", "ja": "これもかなりカッコイイぞ。\nさっそく聞いてみよう！", "zh": "这首歌也十分帅气喔。\n赶快听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "aae54da3a3c5f3414837b3e7495123f3d0685747bca5bda1c127a3830490bc13", "ja": "おおー……！！", "zh": "喔喔……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "aae54da3a3c5f3414837b3e7495123f3d0685747bca5bda1c127a3830490bc13", "ja": "おおー……！！", "zh": "喔喔……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aae54da3a3c5f3414837b3e7495123f3d0685747bca5bda1c127a3830490bc13", "ja": "おおー……！！", "zh": "喔喔……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "86bd9e6bd8f4391110ed22d1ad634b850659bf2d2977da3512b44676877b3bc1", "ja": "すごく、かっこいいです。燃えてきたぞ。", "zh": "真的非常帅气，让人热血沸腾起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d5c5129e5915ae0197761f556128cdbc52c6c18a7794d8d39321b217f356db57", "ja": "それはよかった。この曲に合わせて、\nみんなにはそれぞれの持ち味を生かしてほしい。", "zh": "那真是太好了，我希望你们能配合这首歌，\n好好活用各自的特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "c105600fab50e16036d1fcf562414c431317c7aa515bde0d8d88246c7ab4ec08", "ja": "持ち味……？　瑞希は、なんかいるだけで楽しいし、\n歩はクールなダンスが持ち味だけど、アタシって……。", "zh": "特色……？瑞希她光是人在那边就很欢乐了，\n而步的特色就是会跳很酷的舞，至于我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d88650fe610bef580980cdaff18d88286bcd4bb8ad4deb250543d0591868a374", "ja": "えっ！！　アタシのダンスがクールって\n言った！？　マジか！？　クール！？", "zh": "什么！？你觉得我的舞蹈很酷！？\n真的吗！？很酷！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "3636b9693d3d36e989c9777a4dd46cf156c80bbd3d2bb9677050a2065ca9eb1e", "ja": "うん、クール。", "zh": "嗯，很酷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "38715dd0b3e7f7a4663289267b9130b548801442f42f6e9e107d2f20a57b20ed", "ja": "めちゃ、クール。", "zh": "超酷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3f98ea42329135dde7df5d4aa5193a7949482023297aeaea7a05a46d2eba0a2d", "ja": "マジか！！　じゃあ、どれくらいクールかな！？\nナンバーで言うと！？　3？　2？　それとも～？？", "zh": "真的假的！？那到底是有多酷啊！？\n排名多少！？第三？第二？还是～？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e56247dff6aa00c668203b56c29d99f33c1ad6ff26f2aaf3d5d3e5fae3f2a07c", "ja": "ああ、だいたいナンバー1だぞ、歩！\nで、話を戻……", "zh": "呃呃，大概是第一吧，步！\n好了，言归正……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "465b8b1426d11715c2415dd7f0501f433fc1f9ec9e7515e9902c8b2caf027fb5", "ja": "イエーイッ！　アイム・ナンバーワーーーン！", "zh": "Yeah！I am No.1──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d08a6068142d131513f5cf50ca798e374cc3d43e4f8c79350a991930b1788b8a", "ja": "そ、そうだな！\n……で、話を戻すけど、恵美。", "zh": "对、对啊！\n……好了，言归正传，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "12c656d87c4face166b95c7ff60bacd6c8de6525164bc35a5ac9c77330a5dd65", "ja": "恵美はファッションのセンスが持ち味じゃないか？\nビジュアルは、アイドルにとって重要だし。", "zh": "你的特色不就是对流行穿搭独具慧眼吗？\n毕竟视觉外型对偶像来说是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "bae98ed220168deacf03f919caf6ef6b9f12706c98dc5096420e21d6973b543c", "ja": "ファッションかぁ。にゃはは♪　自信あるような\nないようなってカンジだけど。ま、頑張ってみるねっ！", "zh": "流行穿搭是吗？呀哈哈♪我其实也不知道\n该算是有自信还没自信耶。没关系，我会努力看看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "aa354f9b1df58ac7bf71cabe63bd668f12d0fa7b5bb5bd08e7f5e9d1614b3346", "ja": "自信はどんどん持ってくれ。期待してるぞ！\nもちろん、瑞希と歩にもな！", "zh": "你尽管拿出自信吧，我拭目以待喔！\n瑞希、步，你们当然也一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "d17343c7e91facb563c1fabb8529b6233fb456a90fea1d51d7418e0420cc2fa6", "ja": "はい、私も自分に期待します。\nやるぞ、おー。", "zh": "好的，我也会期待自己的表现。\n要加油啰，喔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fc461eee516fe2cabb0225a0014ee712b9341b42502a0c237403d64222b5e768", "ja": "オー！！\nアタシも、バッチリ決めるからね！！", "zh": "喔──！！\n我也会拿出完美表现的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "dfed10666bdbbc0bb7352689b2299da7350a97e3e33344a93c6e4f342d00fbcb", "ja": "……ところで、{$P$}。", "zh": "……对了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "daefa0e51898e8ca13856c006ae8d55cdd402396c0291ca0c393feff9d0f614d", "ja": "ユニット名は、ありますか。\n……かっこいいのが、いいな。", "zh": "请问我们有团体名称吗？\n……我希望能取个帅气点的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "8fc0a8022ec4d151ec69fe27596101254b22af04d8ff4ab9010d8e0e4f8abac7", "ja": "ああ、一応な。\nサジタリアス、っていうのを考えてるんだ。", "zh": "哦哦，我是有想到一个。\n叫做『Sagittarius』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "274025a749ce4409830c567a60df88d9693ea4e545de988ce4e83726c47dd634", "ja": "サジタリアス！　なんかかっこいいな～！\n……あれ。うーん、どういう意味だっけ？", "zh": "『Sagittarius』！听起来好帅喔～！\n……等等，唔──那是什么意思啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2482c737b36bd065b03f46b34802093c81d5098042952e50a7f844a5d5f4489b", "ja": "サジタリアスは射手座って意味だ。天体公演の\nユニット名は、星座で揃えようと思って。", "zh": "Sagittarius就是射手座的意思。\n我想用十二星座来替天体公演的团体命名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ea690207ee3af6e52862c0c2738f8933ce84b965ee318a891efcec61ce2ec473", "ja": "へえー、射手座かぁ～！\nあ、知ってたけど！", "zh": "是喔～原来是射手座啊～！\n啊，其实我知道啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a232a95e328649ff402fbdf42c85fa83e9e8d54bd6787e907cef21aa07e3479b", "ja": "この歌の疾走感にちなんで、自分の道を矢のように\n突き進むイメージなんだ。どうかな。", "zh": "这首歌很有速度感，我希望你们能像射出去的弓箭一样，\n突破出自己的道路，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "0b546e5a374ef7b048485ea19a6fdeff77f9b70c4d6f17d977046d9c0a1c7aa2", "ja": "めっちゃいいよ！　{$P$}って、\nやっぱセンスいいよね。", "zh": "超棒的！{$P$}，\n你真的很会取名字耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "2dde61b29deec0053d30d1bfc038bcd4ba900635d9185a5a9d6eb68ff33ecf7d", "ja": "矢のように突き進む、そんな、クールで熱い\nアイドルになれたら。……見えてきました。", "zh": "像弓箭一样突破前方，\n如果能成为这么帅气又热血的偶像……我已经能想像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1048_034ayu", "source_sha256": "63853ba65b60aaf87b70b7ae5447fcb3ee50d4593fbdd4d4fdc918be1f293a4f", "ja": "うんうん。クールなだけじゃない、ガッツ！\n切り開く！　みたいな！　ナンバーワンだな！", "zh": "嗯嗯。不只要帅气，还要有Guts！\n有突破！之类的！就是No.1啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "dfef7bc54189b03ef7584285660385f3c2a247c040528d58d9884e34fb7baa47", "ja": "ああ、みんな飲み込みが早いな。\nよし、それじゃあ明日から早速レッスンだ！", "zh": "是啊，看来你们很快就进入状况了。\n好，那明天早上就马上开始练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0068_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_01_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
